<p>Hi,</p>

<p>
  We received a request to reset the password for your Photo Tagger account
  (<%= @user.email_address %>). Click the button below to choose a new password.
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Reset your password", edit_password_url(@token),
        style: "display:inline-block; padding:10px 18px; background:#F5A623; color:#1a1a1a; border-radius:8px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;" %>
</p>

<p style="color:#6B7280; font-size:13px;">
  This link expires in 15 minutes. If you didn’t request this, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>
